{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-8-10","kind":"proposition","title":"性质与证明：连比例与比例与整数","englishTitle":"If numbers fall between each of two numbers and an unit in continued proportion, however many numbers fall between each of them and an unit in continued proportion, so many also will fall between the numbers themselves in continued proportion.","book":8,"number":10,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.10","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.10/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":10,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","contentId":"euclid-8-10","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b8850fe6fdfdefdf1d6c2c3d10abb23c5c02a8a4b11b849931f1fb0b054bd66e","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-8-10.statement","euclid-8-10.construction.1","euclid-8-10.construction.2","euclid-8-10.proof.1","euclid-8-10.proof.2","euclid-8-10.proof.3","euclid-8-10.proof.4","euclid-8-10.proof.5","euclid-8-10.proof.6","euclid-8-10.proof.7","euclid-8-10.proof.8","euclid-8-10.proof.9","euclid-8-10.proof.10","euclid-8-10.proof.11","euclid-8-10.proof.12","euclid-8-10.proof.13","euclid-8-10.proof.14","euclid-8-10.proof.15","euclid-8-10.proof.16","euclid-8-10.conclusion","euclid-8-10.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-8-10.statement","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4f4aafef136fbb3fe1d969ca8d1f5ec42b55efd0ae4516a4e45b9b8b9bbe01b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If numbers fall between each of two numbers and an unit in continued proportion, however many numbers fall between each of them and an unit in continued proportion, so many also will fall between the numbers themselves in continued proportion."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果数字在两个数字之间下降,连比例的单位之间下降,然而,在每一个数字之间下降很多,连比例的单位之间也下降很多,在连比例的数字之间也会下降很多。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83bb7c0cc855572e858f247e5fc9c01ed69ff34f2a45a8ef29d70b5aa036946c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the numbers D, E and F, G respectively fall between the two numbers A, B and the unit C in continued proportion; I say that, as many numbers as have fallen between each of the numbers A, B and the unit C in continued proportion, so many numbers will also fall between A, B in continued proportion."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D、E和F、G数字分别从A、B和连比例的单位 C数字下降;我说,A、B和连比例的单位 C数字中,每个数字减少多少,那么,连比例的A、B数字也将减少多少。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"da1df7b7d4bd4398ee29adcb19def8473489a74c2b419f633fa4fb1123486d87","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let D by multiplying F make H, and let the numbers D, F by multiplying H make K, L respectively."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"D和F的产物是H,D和F乘以H,分别是K、L。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0410863200ce29995a57ac75e85abf4a8adac3e12ba7394d973df87388f57431","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since, as the unit C is to the number D, so is D to E, therefore the unit C measures the number D the same number of times as D measures E. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,单位 C对D的比等于D对E的比,因此,单位 C 整除对D是D 整除的乘以D 整除。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4a4e91f24fe318d50b0ca88c91ebd1cc836244b67b41b2378210a61afde42b3e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit C measures the number D according to the units in D; therefore the number D also measures E according to the units in D; therefore D by multiplying itself has made E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,根据D的单位 C 整除的数字,数字为D;因此,D的单位 E的数字也是整除 E;因此,D乘以本身就已达到E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"53b7bbc0a60eb108de489b088fa75e8e3ede0d56858c996ecea785651e9570fe","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since, as C is to the number D, so is E to A, therefore the unit C measures the number D the same number of times as E measures A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,C对D的比等于E对A的比,因此,单位对C对整除对D是D对A的相同次数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"525961fbc68592d06f395feb621d855ba1093ae6a88ff91be7d8667106740b73","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit C measures the number D according to the units in D; therefore E also measures A according to the units in D; therefore D by multiplying E has made A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据D的单位 C 整除数字,D的D数字;因此,E的单位 A数字,D的整除 A数字,D乘以E, 使A。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"16fc28e7d4948f39a6c50ea5f855bf6133d182288264e7db1e0d3f56594cd7a9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also F by multiplying itself has made G, and by multiplying G has made B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,F乘以本身就已形成G,G乘以本身就形成了B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8c9a229facbdcb6ccb6cd3766358d50de74b0893411cb946894db0704c4cbdd3","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since D by multiplying itself has made E and by multiplying F has made H, therefore, as D is to F, so is E to H. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自D乘以E乘以F乘以H后,D乘以F,D乘以F,D乘以E乘以H,D乘以E乘以H；D 与 F 之比等于 E 与 H 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c9efe4baa08dcceac3cc982b7d306aa7f45c1911973f22791d31320620cccbcf","citations":["euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason also, as D is to F, so is H to G. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,D比F的比例等于H比G；D 与 F 之比等于 H 与 G 之比。 [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ebbbd39cfd752fe0190f097dfb23f7973e14b5b1b706a53024ae8f67e87bab68","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore also, as E is to H, so is H to G."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E对H的比也等于H对G的比；E 与 H 之比等于 H 与 G 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"dbdfb256136f18dfad341c2f26fccce0532fe4927c1fc890ed5666711a175d30","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since D by multiplying the numbers E, H has made A, K respectively, therefore, as E is to H, so is A to K. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,自D乘以E、H后,A、K的比例分别为E和H,相当于A和K；E 与 H 之比等于 A 与 K 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"283ed3b7c6d08622aaa0f16b9b548c950c7bf0d0cb738cbbef52b33a8d27494b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as E is to H, so is D to F; therefore also, as D is to F, so is A to K."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,E对H的比等于D对F的比;因此,D对F的比等于A对K的比；E 与 H 之比等于 D 与 F 之比；D 与 F 之比等于 A 与 K 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"343745a5300f554578b107eda357ba95035213e491383dd6397974a7dac80dd5","citations":["euclid-7-18"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since the numbers D, F by multiplying H have made K, L respectively, therefore, as D is to F, so is K to L. [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,由于D,F乘以H,分别使K,L,D比F等于K比L；D 与 F 之比等于 K 与 L 之比。 [[VII. 18](/principles/euclid-7-18)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b34600c510cfa04b9acfea51329b64efa0f53181dc552202163e58ea11fb859a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as D is to F, so is A to K; therefore also, as A is to K, so is K to L."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,D对F的比等于A对K的比;因此,A对K的比等于K对L的比；D 与 F 之比等于 A 与 K 之比；A 与 K 之比等于 K 与 L 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"41cc07d29476f4ffe1461616ff2ce1f9a39804b8db444e256983c70f44173882","citations":["euclid-7-17"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Further, since F by multiplying the numbers H, G has made L, B respectively, therefore, as H is to G, so is L to B. [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"此外,自F乘以H、G后,L、B的比例分别为H和G,相当于L和B；H 与 G 之比等于 L 与 B 之比。 [[VII. 17](/principles/euclid-7-17)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65192537e95c4eb819c6f26cf311bd8b201878c51480aa7a65f26ce6a112d978","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as H is to G, so is D to F; therefore also, as D is to F, so is L to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,H对G的比等于D对F的比;因此,D对F的比等于L对B的比；H 与 G 之比等于 D 与 F 之比；D 与 F 之比等于 L 与 B 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ccc43eaba46517602251c052c6c56e6458eb0159b34712c055b1254caba5c7cb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it was also proved that, as D is to F, so is A to K and K to L; therefore also, as A is to K, so is K to L and L to B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但也有事实证明,D对F的比等于A对K和K对L的比;因此,A对K的比等于K对L和L对B的比；D 与 F 之比等于 A 与 K 之比；A 与 K 之比等于 K 与 L 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"081e1c57c0219cff9f3e54a1e57b0fcb13427f169c7d9bb76236c46480eb2453","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A, K, L, B are in continued proportion."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A,K,L,B在连比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":19,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b18c1d8295f7816789522959d93eb3bb03c491643e728f1b76190bd51f31adcc","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as many numbers as fall between each of the numbers A, B and the unit C in continued proportion, so many also will fall between A, B in continued proportion. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,在A、B和连比例的单位、C之间,人数多得是下降的,同样多的是连比例的A、B和D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-8-10.source","contentId":"euclid-8-10","revisionId":"euclid-8-10@raw-b8850fe6fdfdefdf","order":20,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"76aaefdf88f609baf5d81ad773b44ec83ec998120b06740179374cedb882f4d1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.10/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.10\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-8-10:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-10.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-def-20","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"VII. Def. 20"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-10:euclid-7-17:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-10.proof.6","euclid-8-10.proof.9","euclid-8-10.proof.13"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-17","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"VII. 17"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-8-10:euclid-7-18:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-8-10","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-8-10.proof.7","euclid-8-10.proof.11"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-18","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.10","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:8.prop.10/","sourceLabel":"VII. 18"}}],"incomingEdges":[],"dependencies":[{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-8-10:euclid-7-def-20:explicit","id":"euclid-7-def-20","book":7,"number":20,"kind":"definition","title":"成比例的整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-8-10:euclid-7-17:explicit","id":"euclid-7-17","book":7,"number":17,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"},{"edgeId":"edge:euclid-8-10:euclid-7-18:explicit","id":"euclid-7-18","book":7,"number":18,"kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：比例与整数","provenance":"explicit_source_reference"}],"dependents":[],"visualization":{"level":"concept_illustration","rendererId":"concept-number","rationale":"The current renderer is selected by a broad geometry family and must not be presented as this proposition’s exact construction."},"sourceIssues":[]}
